:: Day2_SQ_Ali [day2 sidequest neighborhood ali]
<<nobr>>
<<centerImage "image/location/park.png">>

<p>Ali is doing his crossword when I walk in. He looks up, pen between his teeth, eyes narrowing at the clue he's stuck on.</p>

<p><strong>"Alex! My favorite. Seven letters, 'gradual change in form.' You know this?"</strong></p>

<p>I think. "Morphing?"</p>

<p>"That's seven." He writes it in. Studies it. "Doesn't fit the intersections. I'll come back to it." He caps his pen. "What do you need?"</p>

<p>"Just looking around."</p>

<p>"You always say that. And you always buy a Gatorade."</p>

<p>He's right. I buy a Gatorade. Blue, this time.</p>

<p>"Hey, Ali. You know that shop down the street? Kinky Kitty?"</p>

<p>His mustache twitches. The twitch contains multitudes: amusement, judgment, curiosity, restraint. "The cat shop. Yes. I know it."</p>

<p>"What's it like?"</p>

<p>"I've never been inside." A pause that lasts exactly long enough to be diplomatic. "The woman who runs it comes in sometimes. Tall, dark hair, lots of jewelry. Buys energy drinks and chocolate bars. She told me once that her shop sells 'lifestyle accessories.' I said 'so do I' and pointed at my display of reading glasses. She laughed." Another pause. "I like her. She's honest about what she sells. Most people aren't honest about anything."</p>

<p>He hands me my change. One seventy-five, exact, without looking at the register.</p>

<p>"Ali, the crossword. 'Gradual change in form.' Is it 'evolve'?"</p>

<p>"Six letters."</p>

<p>"Reshape?"</p>

<p>"Seven! Let me check the intersections..." He grabs his pen, writes, nods. "That works. Reshape. Good word." He tears a strip of paper from his crossword page and writes something on it. "Here. Discount. Next Gatorade is on the house."</p>

<p>"You don't have to..."</p>

<p>"I know I don't have to. I want to. You're a good kid, Alex. Remember that, even when things get... reshaped."</p>

<p>He says the last word with a half-smile that suggests he means more than the crossword. I pocket the coupon and leave with a weird feeling in my chest, like Ali sees something coming that I can't.</p>

<<set $aliFamiliarity += 2>>
<<set $aliCrosswordDay2 to true>>
<<set $aliCrosswordClue to "reshape">>
<<set $money -= 1>>
<<spendTime 1>>
<<set $currentMapLocation to "neighborhood">>

